{"v":4,"catch":"能在Nintendo Switch遊玩的Game Boy Advance遊戲集","desc":"集合各式各樣Game Boy Advance遊戲的「Nintendo Switch Online + 擴充包」加入者限定遊戲軟體《Game Boy Advance™ – Nintendo Classics》。\n\n只要從選擇作品畫面選擇想要遊玩的遊戲便能立即啟動。可在不同遊戲之間切換遊玩。設有隨時隨地儲存和倒回等便利功能，就算只有一點空閒時間也可輕鬆遊玩。\n\n除了鄰近主機通訊遊玩，線上遊玩亦支援最多4人遊玩，可和朋友一起享受對戰或協力遊玩。\n※因應玩家人數，需要準備同樣數量的Nintendo Switch主機。各玩家亦需要加入「Nintendo Switch Online + 擴充包」。","publisher":"Nintendo","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["其他"],"players":"單機 1 人 · 本機通訊 2–4 人 · 網路 2–4 人","langs":["日文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":4,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e854302fa919d3e4652565205c5e3c7f38ff929d76b15c69500b78a06b99785b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3664c5b8f7fa33816df6c08ae4602805f8e0e2fdb16e54821c4d9c0bf45fa870.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/493e49f334f884fa8dc8707efec32a32ef1747bc667d9dacf02072d8eeef9568.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2da733a2b5b968410bc48f157605fbe78105a126bae9d29b4261d9fca3660a4e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d350864b48df74adaab1692a34ba3b546805069138c26c0de9082ab734b73a80.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5f69ae543c36d3ad40a0890c69215b225ee1a82241d828e732bc9a8daf6bef70.jpg"],"titleId":"0100555017574000","dlc":[],"vids":["SfiL9y_2tug","p24Lbz7Nckg","DAtsVJMKdCE","t0s49Wlv5sg","5yI9NY3WQL4","jUWC1CkS2ng","gbX9T2UIRp4","83GRD94lq9U","Ad5ixUSksi4","Mb8r2qq0c1A","vSImUI40WOs","MGuRheS44WM","PSqILeUS9yU","qDQkhHBoifw","SVXLQhma17s","-OWGgO4g90w","s4ooxNO0YSc","If4juxfBo_s","1FDY3BR7Egg"]}